  "content": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">재<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">훼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby>’랗 <ruby style=\"position: relative\">심<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby>애’에 뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative\">옌<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˏ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative\">랑<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˏ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EqoQhUaLYsI?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">春雨<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">춘ˉ허ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">像<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">츌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"hît\">彼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">出<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">춛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">過去<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">궤`킈</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夢<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    chūn-hōr chiṵ-hît-chût-kuè-khi’e bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    우<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">심ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">故意<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">거`이</rt></ruby> 허<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">淋<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">람ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    u-sīm-láng kòr-i hor-lám\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">已經<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby>음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">願<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">꽌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">곻<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">再<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">재`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">期待<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">기태ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    î-kiēng-m-goan-kôh-jài-ki-thāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">傷心<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">셩ˉ심ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby> 뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">目滓<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">빡새`</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siōng-sīm-láng bo-bak-sài\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #5 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">總<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">정ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">多情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">도ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’랗\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jông-si-gùn tō-jiéng’lah\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #6 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">遮邇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쟣ˆ니</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">軟<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">능ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心肝<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ괄ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jiâh-ni-nn̂g-sīm-koâ̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #7 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">제<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">奈<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">내ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">感情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">才<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby>에뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby>뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">煞<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">쇃</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jē-bo-nāi’e kâm-jiéng jiâh-e-bo-lai-bo-soah\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">到今<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄀᅷ`달ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">算<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">승</rt></ruby>’래 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">十<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">잡-</rt></ruby>똬<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">冬<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">당ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kàu-tâ̰ sng’lai jap-roa-tâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">等待<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">단ˆ태-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">花蕊<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">훼ˉ뤼`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">猶未<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">얗ˆ쀄-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">紅<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">앙ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tân-thai-huē-lùi yâh-bue-áng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">原諒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">꽌령-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">多情<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">도ˉ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goan-liong-tō-jiéng’e goà\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愈<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뚜ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">想<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">슐-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愈<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뚜ˆ-</rt></ruby>음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">願<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">꽌ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    rû-siṵ-rû-m-goān\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">再會<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">재`훼ˉ</rt></ruby>’랗 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心愛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ애</rt></ruby>’에 뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">緣<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">옌ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jài-huē’lah sīm-ai’e bo-yén’e láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">若<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">나</rt></ruby>뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">애</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">石頭<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">죻ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> 마뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">彩工<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">채ˆ강ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    na-bo-ai jioh-tháu ma-bo-châi-kâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style='font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans'>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">過去<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">궤`킈</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">像<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">츌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一出<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇춛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">慐人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">껑랑ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">故事<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">거`수ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kuè-khi chiṵ-jit-chût-gong-láng’e kòr-sū\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">聊<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">ᄅᆤˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夢<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bo-liáu’e bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">再會<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">재`훼ˉ</rt></ruby>’랗 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心愛<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">심ˉ애</rt></ruby>’에 뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">緣<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">옌ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jài-huē’lah sīm-ai’e bo-yén’e láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">六月<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">락뀋ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">茉莉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">빡니ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">遐邇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">햫ˆ니</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">仔<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">아ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">芳<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">팡ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lak-guêh’e bak-nī hiâh-ni-â-phâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">祝福<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">젹ˆ헉ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">親像<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">春天<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">춘ˉ틸ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">花蕊<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">훼ˉ뤼`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    jiôrk-hôrk-lì chīn-chiṵ-chūn-thḭ̂’e huē-lùi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">遐邇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">햫ˆ니</rt><